# Who must review a change to the release gates' own files.
#
# The Release Policy Guard cannot stop a pull request from editing the
# workflow that runs it, or the manifest and scripts it reads. Review by a
# code owner is what stops that. This file names the paths; the setting
# "Require review from Code Owners" on `main` is what makes it binding, and
# only a repository admin can turn that on.
# See docs/runbooks/release-gates.md, "What the guard cannot do".

/.github/workflows/ @Geoffe-Ga
/release/ @Geoffe-Ga
/scripts/release/ @Geoffe-Ga
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Geoffe-Ga
